      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really strong way to put it. Since the grant is so competitive, I want to make sure we're totally airtight. If a critic were to argue that managed conservation is actually necessary for protecting endangered species that can't survive without human intervention, how should I dismiss that? I want to make sure we frame their argument as being fundamentally flawed or even dangerous to the ecosystem's long-term health.",
